# The Emissary at Port Windurst at status 0 (the mission current): Melek, Ada, Gold Skull and Josef play their own
# scripts' events (42, 44, 43, 45: no section arm); at status 1 (a GM): Ada, Gold Skull and Josef the same; Melek
# plays 48, whose finish ends The Emissary and begins The Emissary Windurst at status 2.
lists PortWindurst/Ada/onTrigger PortWindurst/Gold_Skull/onTrigger PortWindurst/Josef/onTrigger PortWindurst/Melek/onTrigger PortWindurst/onEventFinish/48 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/61
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-80.6,-5.5,157.3 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissary current
login
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
trigger Ada
finish-if-event
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Josef
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 1
trigger Ada
finish-if-event
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Josef
finish-if-event
trigger Melek
finish
